## 3. §2 Compound Assignment Audit

Grep for `+= (int)(` and `-= (int)(` in `Tank.java`: 11 sites found.

| Sites | Java Source Line | Bytecode / Semantics | Classification | Confidence | Discriminating Input Shape |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **1–2** | `conto.xy += (int)(this.speed / 5.0f);`<br>`conto.xy -= (int)(this.speed / 5.0f);` | `getfield ContO.xy; i2f; getfield speed; ldc 5.0f; fdiv; fadd; f2i; putfield` (LHS widened, single end truncation) | **Case A** | HIGH | `speed` positive, `conto.xy` small non-zero fractional step |
| **3–5** | `lx[n2] -= (int)(this.lspeed[j2] * (...));`<br>`lz[n3] += (int)(this.lspeed[j2] * (...));`<br>`ly[n4] -= (int)(this.lspeed[j2] * (...));` | RHS float32 trig/speed product truncated before int32 subtraction/addition | **Case B** | HIGH | Coordinate positive, RHS delta negative fraction |
| **6–8** | `conto.x -= (int)(this.speed * (...));`<br>`conto.z += (int)(this.speed * (...));`<br>`conto.y -= (int)(this.speed * (...));` | RHS velocity float32 component truncated before integer subtraction/addition | **Case B** | HIGH | Coordinate positive, RHS delta negative fraction |
| **9–11** | `this.gxz += (int)(70.0 + Math.random() * 20.0);`<br>`this.gxz -= (int)(70.0 + Math.random() * 20.0);`<br>`this.gxz += (int)(Math.random() * 40.0 - 20.0);` | `d2i` before integer add/sub | **Case B** | HIGH | Angle positive, delta negative fraction |

